OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny patchy frost and fog in the
OL,6,Feast will readily clear through
OL,7,Fmorning. Leaving a dry and bright day
OL,8,Fwith cloud increasing to the west
OL,9,Fthrough the day, with a potential for
OL,10,Flight rain by the evening. Moderate
OL,11,Feasterly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud and rain will continue
OL,14,Fto spread north and east overnight,
OL,15,Fwith some heavier bursts possible
OL,16,Fthrough the early hours. Moderate to
OL,17,Ffresh southeasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
