OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy and wet day for most
OL,6,Fwith some heavier bursts possible
OL,7,Fthroughout the day. Brisk easterly
OL,8,Fwinds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,11,Fand wet conditions continuing into
OL,12,FWednesday, particularly across
OL,13,FCornwall. Cloudy and rather damp
OL,14,Fthrough Thursday before things turn
OL,15,Fdrier and brighter through for Friday.
OL,16,FTurning cooler on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
